/development/nimauria/project-gracemeria/**/title-updates/
/development/nimauria/project-gracemeria/**/private/
/development/nimauria/project-gracemeria/**/scratch/
/development/nimauria/project-gracemeria/**/.vs/
/development/nimauria/project-gracemeria/**/.vscode/
/development/nimauria/project-gracemeria/**/.idea/
/development/nimauria/project-gracemeria/**/__pycache__/
